                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "My friend had cheese and bacon croissant while I had cheese and egg. The portions are generous and also delicious. The owner and staff are really nice. They came to ask if I would like to sit inside because they were afraid it could be too hot outside. It\u0027s difficult to find a stop with quiet outdoor seating in Dihua Old Street, so I highly recommend this restaurant if you also enjoy sitting outside like me 😄",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
